    "original_url": "https://radiodalsan.com/2026/10/29/au-advances-drive-to-make-democracy-a-lived-experience-across-africa-with-media-and-socialisation-at-its-core/?utm_source=rss&#038;utm_medium=rss&#038;utm_campaign=au-advances-drive-to-make-democracy-a-lived-experience-across-africa-with-media-and-socialisation-at-its-core",
